  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi,\n\nWhen using OculusLink from meta Quest and playing with a VRChat client on a PC, AirLink communication may be cut off unexpectedly. When I reconnect and return to VRChat, my avatar is stuck in the ground and I can't move or operate it.\n\nIn this situation, it is necessary to exit VRChat and restart it, which takes time and effort.\n\nAt the time of this reconnection, I would like to have a mechanism for recovery operation, such as restoring the state of the avatar to the state immediately before the connection was lost, or resetting/respawning.",
